  "instructions": [
    "In a large stone bowl, combine the halved cherry tomatoes, thinly sliced red onion, chopped parsley, and chopped cilantro.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice, olive oil, salt, black pepper, and berbere spice.",
    "Pour the dressing over the tomato mixture and toss to combine.",
    "Sprinkle the minced garlic over the top of the azifa and toss again to combine.",
    "Let the azifa sit at room temperature for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Serve the azifa chilled or at room temperature, garnished with additional parsley and cilantro if desired."
